{
  "rationale": "We separate sensing (obstacle detection) and motion (action execution) into two plant automata. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and ensure full_rotate is only used as a last resort. The design prioritizes forward exploration, uses random_walk for coverage in clear states, and applies minimal recovery before resuming exploration.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion to modularize uncontrollable and controllable event handling.",
    "Specification automata enforce safe action selection, conservative obstacle recovery, and last-resort full_rotate only after repeated failures."
  ],
